# Fault names for nbt_health: "MODULE DTC text" (DTC = all three bytes, hex). Keep text short (~30 chars).
# Texts from BMW SGBD fault tables (emdzej docs: d73n57e0, cas4_2, komb01, nbt, frm3, ihka01, zgw_01), shortened.
DME 24F700 Fuel filter heater circuit open
CAS 93076B Parked power cut (30B budget)
CAS 9308A7 Rear remote battery low
KOMBI B7F67D Cluster watchdog reset
NBT B7F84D Mic 1 wire open
NBT B7F884 Head unit flash file error
NBT B7F8AE Rear screens Ethernet no link
NBT B7F8E5 SSH mode active (our unlock)
NBT E1C440 Head unit reset
FRM 800F93 Home-light repeat lock
IHKA 8011CE Volume knob stuck
ZGW 801C15 Did not sleep properly (30B)
ZGW 801C20 Central fault memory full
